It's CE Chat, Google
Cloud Networking 102.

00:40:29.505 --> 00:40:32.510
It's cloud routing
and VPC pairing.

00:40:32.510 --> 00:40:34.570
Thank you again for your time.

00:40:34.570 --> 00:40:39.790
And feel free to go
to the Cloud IoT core.

00:40:39.790 --> 00:40:42.010
I mentioned there was this--

00:40:42.010 --> 00:40:44.900
let me see-- go to
Cloud IoT core website.

00:40:44.900 --> 00:40:49.330
You can sign up for the Cloud
IoT Provisioning early access.

00:40:49.330 --> 00:40:54.480
And also, you can sign up for
the Edge TPU and Cloud IoT Edge

00:40:54.480 --> 00:40:57.880
early access, as
well, on our website.

00:40:57.880 --> 00:40:58.380
OK.

00:40:58.380 --> 00:40:59.490
Well, thanks again.

